 her former personality: that of Mystere, who acts in a patronizing manner toward her master Kanata. However, Mystere remembers detecting a signal from Histoire, a mystical city, during her former life as an artificially intelligent magus.\n\n\n\nMeanwhile, Tokio disappears from Rock Town while hunting down the ghosts of his past; however, shocking revelations await the deeper his search goes. As Kanata, his childhood friend Ellie, and the magus diva Ciel set out for Histoire, a hostile organization named Ideal sends assassins after them. If Kanata wants to stand a chance at accomplishing his dream, he must uncover the unpleasant truth about Ideal—and some of his closest allies.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["SYNDUALITY Noir 第2クール",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-56764":"2024-04-01T10:36:38Z","serial-56579":"2024-03-26T09:36:51Z","serial-56833":"2024-03-30T19:36:21Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-56764","serial-56579","serial-56833"],"relatedMalIds":[53026],"rating":7.14,"relations":[{"id":53026,"relation":"prequel"}]}]}